Private account data are kept outside this distribution.

Set the fixed environment variable

  CHECKWRITER_PRIVATE

to the directory containing private account subdirectories, for example:

  $CHECKWRITER_PRIVATE/hancock-whitney/account.json

Private files should contain only account-specific data.  Bank layouts,
logos, bank identification, and the default Nimra MICR font are public
distribution resources.

If CHECKWRITER_PRIVATE is unset, draw-check uses harmless demonstration
values so the public distribution can generate a sample check by itself.
